WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.539
The first panel establishes a place.

00:00:02.539 --> 00:00:06.137
The second moves closer to the object that matters.

00:00:06.137 --> 00:00:09.523
The third allows a pause before the next action.

00:00:09.523 --> 00:00:15.449
Notice how a narrow panel changes the amount of information you can take in at once.

00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:21.092
The gutters keep each moment separate while inviting the reader to connect them.

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:25.960
These original boards are a layout exercise for the Lantern District.

